@host = http://localhost:3000

### Server info
GET {{host}}/
Accept: application/json

### Health check
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Unknown route -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/does-not-exist

### Session (page-load bootstrap; always 200, cookie-driven)
GET {{host}}/api/auth/session
Cookie: refreshToken=REPLACE_WITH_REFRESH_COOKIE

### Register (sets httpOnly refresh cookie when `remember: true`)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Str0ngPass1!",
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "remember": true
}

### Login (sets httpOnly refresh cookie; `remember: false` -> session cookie)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Str0ngPass1!",
  "remember": true
}

### Refresh (cookie-driven; rotates the refresh token, old one revoked)
# Re-presenting an already-revoked token kills the whole family (TOKEN_REUSED).
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Cookie: refreshToken=REPLACE_WITH_REFRESH_COOKIE

### Logout (revokes the whole refresh-token family + clears the cookie)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
Cookie: refreshToken=REPLACE_WITH_REFRESH_COOKIE

### Me (protected)
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Update profile (protected; upserts the address)
PATCH {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "phone": "+1 555 123 4567",
  "birthDate": "1995-06-15",
  "address": {
    "state": "California",
    "city": "San Francisco",
    "line": "123 Market St, Apt 4"
  }
}

### Upload a file (auth required; multipart, field name `file`)
# Returns { url, key, size, mimeType }. Attach `url` wherever it belongs —
# e.g. PATCH /api/auth/me { "image": "<url>" } for an avatar.
POST {{host}}/api/uploads
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="avatar.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./uploads/REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_FILE
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### Change or set password (protected; sets password for OAuth-only accounts)
PATCH {{host}}/api/auth/me/password
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "Str0ngPass1!",
  "newPassword": "N3wStr0ngPass2!"
}

### Delete account (protected; requires password if one is set)
DELETE {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "N3wStr0ngPass2!"
}
